@startuml
title Component overview

package "Config (static data)" {
  [BiomeGraph\n(adjacency, size ranges,\nshape hints, feature toggles)] as Graph
}

package "Runtime" {
  [Region Solver] as Solver
  [Region Cache\n(macro-cell -> biome-id)] as Cache
  [Density Router] as Density
  [Feature Gate] as Features
}

Graph --> Solver : rules + size ranges
Solver --> Cache : write (once per region)
Cache --> Solver : read fixed\nwest/north edges
Cache --> Density : biome-id per column
Cache --> Features : biome-id per column
Graph --> Density : shape hints per biome
Graph --> Features : feature toggles per biome

note right of Cache
  Only source of truth for
  "what biome is at x,z".
  No climate-noise sampling
  anywhere downstream.
end note
@enduml
